description	"N5 Sentry Droid aka New Republic Security Droid

Patrol units with reinforced armor, equipped to subdue unruly prisoners with standard weaponry and built-in magnetics.

^2Weaponry:
- Droid Melee
-- 25% more knockback
-- 50% less damage
-- 65% slower RoF
-- Heavyweight
-- Punch/grab only
- Stun Baton (Purple Saber)
-- No Block
-- Chain Limit: 1
-- Shocks on hit
-- Non-disarmable
-- 40% shorter
-- 166% thicker
- Magnetic Attractor Device (Minigun 1)
-- Pulls on hit
-- 99% less damage/FP drain
-- 200% slower RoF
- Modified DH-17 Blaster Pistol (A280 2)
-- Non-disarmable
-- Mag reload
- Magnetic Trap Mine (3)
-- Pulls/disarms on det
-- Non-disarmable
-- 50% less damage

^5Powers:
- Magnetic (Force) Pull ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Strength (3)
- Battery Recharge (2)
- Magnetic Plating
- Beskar (1)
- Blast Armor
- Assemble (1)
- Getup (1)
- Wookalike

^3Abilities:
- Shoulder Barge (1) ^3[Melee CS2]"